# Deploy to chypulis.top

This repo ships static HTML to FTP on push to `main`. Do not invent a new host or upload method.

| Folder | Live URL |
|---|---|
| `domain/` | https://chypulis.top/ |
| `presentation/` | https://chypulis.top/fgg-presentation/ |
| `corporate/` | https://chypulis.top/corporate/ |
| `yachts/` | https://chypulis.top/fgg-yachts/ |
| `planes/` | https://chypulis.top/fgg-planes/ |

After HTML or asset edits: commit, push `main`, then confirm the matching GitHub Actions deploy job. Workflows live in `.github/workflows/deploy-*.yml`. Secrets are already on the GitHub repo (`FTP_SERVER`, `FTP_USERNAME`, `FTP_PASSWORD`).

Never commit FTP passwords. Local `*.py` helpers are gitignored. Skip `venv/`, PDFs, and generator scripts on deploy.
